#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:573 C/gnumeric.xml:154
msgid "The components of the first panel"
msgstr "Delarna i den första panelen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:576
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> - The file encoding selection menu."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> – Meny för filens teckenkodning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:581
msgid ""
"This drop down menu provides a list of encoding schemes for the characters "
"in the text file. By default, <application>Gnumeric</application> selects "
"the encoding scheme used by the locale of the user. See <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-encoding\"/> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Här finns en lista med kodningar för textfilens tecken. Som standard väljer "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> den kodning som gäller för användarens "
"systemlokal. Mer information finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-"
"complex-encoding\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:593
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> - The line break character selector."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> – Väljare för tecken vid radslut."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:598
msgid ""
"These three check boxes can be selected individually or together to define "
"the sequences which will be interpreted as line break indicators. Generally,"
" selecting all three boxes will produce the correct results."
msgstr ""
"Markera en, två eller alla tre kryssrutor för att ange vilka tecken som ska "
"tolkas som radslut. Vanligtvis blir resultatet rätt om alla tre är "
"markerade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:606
msgid ""
"The errors produced if the wrong combination of boxes is selected will "
"include the entire file being placed on a single line, empty lines appearing"
" between the lines of the file, or undefined symbols appearing at the "
"beginning or end of almost every line. See <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"textImport-complex-lineBreak\"/> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Om du markerar fel kombination kan hela filen hamna på en enda rad, tomma "
"rader infogas mellan raderna eller odefinierade symboler visas i början "
"eller slutet av nästan varje rad. Mer information finns i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-lineBreak\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:619
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">3</emphasis> - The data structuring system selector."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">3</emphasis> – Väljare för datastruktur."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:624
msgid ""
"These two push buttons allow the choice between the two different "
"structuring schemes, data structured by placing a separating character "
"between the data values and data organized in fixed width columns. Note that"
" this choice will determine which panel will be shown as the second panel of"
" the druid. See <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-dataStruct\"/> "
"for more details."
msgstr ""
"Med de här två knapparna väljer du mellan två metoder: data där värden "
"skiljs åt av avgränsningstecken och data ordnade i kolumner med fast bredd. "
"Valet avgör vilken panel som visas som den andra i guiden. Mer information "
"finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-dataStruct\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:638
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">4</emphasis> - The line range spinbuttons."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">4</emphasis> – Stegningsrutor för radintervall."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:642
msgid ""
"These two spin buttons allow the user to select the start and end rows for "
"the data import. The spin boxes can be used either by typing a new value in "
"the text entry area where the numbers are displayed, or by using the mouse "
"button to click on the up arrow to increase the number and the down arrow to"
" decrease the number."
msgstr ""
"Med de här två stegningsrutorna anger du första och sista raden som ska "
"importeras. Skriv ett värde i fältet eller klicka på uppåtpilen för att öka "
"det och på nedåtpilen för att minska det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:651
msgid ""
"For instance, if the text file contained a large header area with meta "
"information, this header could be excluded from the data imported to the "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet by increasing the number of "
"the starting, \"From\", line."
msgstr ""
"Om textfilen till exempel innehåller ett långt sidhuvud med metadata kan du "
"hoppa över det genom att öka numret för startraden ”Från” i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:662
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">5</emphasis> - The preview area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">5</emphasis> – Förhandsgranskningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:666
msgid ""
"This area displays a preview of the file as it will be interpreted when the "
"settings that are currently selected in this first panel are applied."
msgstr ""
"Här visas en förhandsgranskning av hur filen tolkas med de inställningar som"
" valts i den första panelen."
